---
// Post 12 (Backtest) figure: SharpeBand. Inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp12-sharpeband">
  <div class="atp12-sharpeband-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 292" role="img" aria-label="Ranges of the measured Sharpe ratio when the true value is 1.0: with 1 year of daily data the 95 percent range is minus 0.97 to 2.97, with 2 years minus 0.39 to 2.39, with 5 years 0.12 to 1.88 and with 10 years 0.38 to 1.62. Only the 5 and 10 year ranges stay above zero.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>A true Sharpe of 1.0 looks like this after N years</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sharpe thật bằng 1,0 trông như thế này sau N năm</tspan></text>
<line x1="240.0" y1="50" x2="240.0" y2="236" class="grid" />
<text x="240.0" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s">-1</text>
<line x1="365.0" y1="50" x2="365.0" y2="236" class="ax" />
<text x="365.0" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s">0</text>
<line x1="490.0" y1="50" x2="490.0" y2="236" class="grid" />
<text x="490.0" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s">1</text>
<line x1="615.0" y1="50" x2="615.0" y2="236" class="grid" />
<text x="615.0" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s">2</text>
<line x1="740.0" y1="50" x2="740.0" y2="236" class="grid" />
<text x="740.0" y="254" text-anchor="middle" class="s">3</text>
<text x="20" y="81" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>1 year</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 năm</tspan></text>
<line x1="243.8" y1="76" x2="736.2" y2="76" class="redl" style="stroke-width:5" />
<circle cx="490.0" cy="76" r="5" class="mutf" />
<text x="748.2" y="81" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>[−0.97, 2.97]</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>[−0,97, 2,97]</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="123" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>2 years</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 năm</tspan></text>
<line x1="316.2" y1="118" x2="663.8" y2="118" class="redl" style="stroke-width:5" />
<circle cx="490.0" cy="118" r="5" class="mutf" />
<text x="675.8" y="123" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>[−0.39, 2.39]</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>[−0,39, 2,39]</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="165" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>5 years</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>5 năm</tspan></text>
<line x1="380.0" y1="160" x2="600.0" y2="160" class="goldl" style="stroke-width:5" />
<circle cx="490.0" cy="160" r="5" class="mutf" />
<text x="612.0" y="165" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>[0.12, 1.88]</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>[0,12, 1,88]</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="207" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>10 years</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10 năm</tspan></text>
<line x1="412.5" y1="202" x2="567.5" y2="202" class="goldl" style="stroke-width:5" />
<circle cx="490.0" cy="202" r="5" class="mutf" />
<text x="579.5" y="207" class="t13"><tspan data-lang-en>[0.38, 1.62]</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>[0,38, 1,62]</tspan></text>
<text x="490" y="274" class="s" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>95% range of the measured Sharpe ratio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khoảng 95% của Sharpe đo được</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Computed: standard error of an annualised Sharpe ratio = sqrt((1 + SR²/2) / (T − 1)) × sqrt(252) with SR taken per day, from the Bailey and López de Prado formula for normal returns.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tính toán: sai số chuẩn của Sharpe quy năm = sqrt((1 + SR²/2) / (T − 1)) × sqrt(252) với SR tính theo ngày, theo công thức Bailey và López de Prado cho lợi suất chuẩn.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp12-sharpeband { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp12-sharpeband-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp12-sharpeband svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp12-sharpeband text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .t13 { font-size: 13px; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp12-sharpeband .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp12-sharpeband .hole { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp12-sharpeband figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
